{"seq":2,"slug":"versioning-governance","title":"版本与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontend-engineering/engineering/versioning-governance","wordCount":1749,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"版本与治理\">版本与治理</h1><p>让每个团队自由地选版本、改契约、独立发布，是微前端的卖点；但完全放任的自由会迅速滑向混乱——三个片段各带不同主版本的 React、某团队悄悄改了事件载荷把下游搞崩、设计系统在各片段里漂移成五种按钮。治理要解的就是这个两难：既给团队足够自由以维持自治，又守住若干底线以维持整体可用。它不是用强约束消灭自由，而是用恰到好处的规则让自由不互相伤害。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>治理的术语围绕&quot;哪些必须统一、哪些可以放任&quot;这条分界线展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>治理两难</td>\n<td>既给团队自由维持自治，又守若干底线维持整体可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享单例</td>\n<td>多片段复用同一份依赖，仅当主版本相同（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta major = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）时可成立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强/弱治理</td>\n<td>核心运行时强治理（主版本全局统一），业务库弱治理（片段自管）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>契约测试</td>\n<td>消费方声明依赖、提供方在 CI 里验证，把&quot;别改坏下游&quot;变成确定性门禁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黄金路径</td>\n<td>平台团队提供的预配置脚手架与基线，沿其走即自动满足治理底线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"共享依赖的版本协商语义\">共享依赖的版本协商语义</h2><p>治理最具体、最容易出血的战场是共享依赖的版本。<a href=\"../integration/runtime-module-federation\">运行时与 Module Federation</a> 已讲过 <code>singleton</code>/<code>requiredVersion</code> 的运行机制，这里从治理视角看它的后果与策略。</p>\n<p>核心约束来自 semver 的兼容性规则：主版本变化即不兼容。把版本写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">major.minor.patch</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">min</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，两个片段的共享依赖能合并为同一单例，当且仅当主版本相同，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta major = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。这条数学事实直接决定了治理边界——所有片段的 React 主版本必须一致，否则共享协商要么失败退化成各加载一份（体积翻倍，见 <a href=\"performance-pitfalls\">性能与陷阱</a>），要么在 <code>strictVersion</code> 下直接抛错。次版本与补丁版本通常可向上兼容，协商时取满足各方约束的最高版本作为单例。</p>\n<p>治理策略由此清晰：对<strong>核心运行时</strong>（React、框架）施加强治理——全组织对主版本做统一的、有计划的升级窗口，绝不允许某团队单方面跨主版本。对<strong>业务库</strong>施加弱治理——只要不进共享单例，各片段自带自管。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[共享依赖治理] --&gt; B{是核心运行时?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是 React/框架| C[强治理&lt;br/&gt;主版本全组织统一&lt;br/&gt;有计划升级窗口]&#10;  B --&gt;|否 业务库| D[弱治理&lt;br/&gt;片段自带自管]&#10;  C --&gt; E{主版本一致?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是 同 major| F[协商出单一单例&lt;br/&gt;体积最优]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[退化各带一份/报错&lt;br/&gt;体积翻倍]&#10;  D --&gt; H[不进共享单例&lt;br/&gt;互不影响]\">flowchart TD\n  A[共享依赖治理] --&gt; B{是核心运行时?}\n  B --&gt;|是 React/框架| C[强治理&lt;br/&gt;主版本全组织统一&lt;br/&gt;有计划升级窗口]\n  B --&gt;|否 业务库| D[弱治理&lt;br/&gt;片段自带自管]\n  C --&gt; E{主版本一致?}\n  E --&gt;|是 同 major| F[协商出单一单例&lt;br/&gt;体积最优]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[退化各带一份/报错&lt;br/&gt;体积翻倍]\n  D --&gt; H[不进共享单例&lt;br/&gt;互不影响]</pre><h2 id=\"契约-让片段独立演进而不互相打破\">契约：让片段独立演进而不互相打破</h2><p>共享依赖之外，治理的第二战场是片段之间的契约。<a href=\"independent-deployment\">独立部署</a> 已指出部署不再原子、版本偏斜不可避免，于是片段交互必须靠向后兼容的契约来容忍任意新旧组合。治理要把&quot;契约&quot;从口头约定变成可执行的工程制度。</p>\n<p>契约的演进遵循 semver 思维：新增能力走次版本、向后兼容；破坏性变更走主版本、需显式迁移。设契约的提供方版本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、消费方期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，安全的前提是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_p \\geq v_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且主版本相同——这与 <a href=\"../concerns/shared-state-comms\">共享状态与通信</a> 里事件契约的兼容判据是同一条规则在治理层的复用。具体到事件载荷、暴露的远程模块接口、共享的全局上下文形状，都属于受治理的契约面。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>治理对象</th>\n<th>治理强度</th>\n<th>兼容规则</th>\n<th>守护手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心运行时（React）</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>主版本须全局一致</td>\n<td>统一升级窗口 + 构建期校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务库</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>片段内自管</td>\n<td>无需全局协调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件/接口契约</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>向后兼容（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_p \\geq v_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>消费者驱动契约测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设计系统</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>版本化组件库</td>\n<td>构建时集成 + design tokens</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"用契约测试守护-而非用人盯\">用契约测试守护，而非用人盯</h2><p>契约写下来若没有自动化守护，迟早被某次&quot;看起来无害&quot;的改动悄悄破坏。治理的关键工程实践是<strong>消费者驱动契约测试</strong>（consumer-driven contract testing，Pact 思路）：由消费方声明&quot;我依赖你提供的这部分契约&quot;，提供方在自己的 CI 里针对所有消费方的契约期望跑验证，一旦改动会破坏某个消费方，提供方自己的流水线就先红，发布被拦在生产之外。</p>\n<p>这把&quot;别改坏下游&quot;从靠人沟通、靠 code review 肉眼盯，变成了 CI 里的确定性门禁。它对微前端尤为关键，因为各片段独立部署、提供方根本不会在自己改动时去构建消费方——没有契约测试，破坏只会在生产环境、在某个版本偏斜组合下才暴露。契约测试让 <a href=\"independent-deployment\">独立部署</a> 的版本偏斜从&quot;定时炸弹&quot;变成&quot;发布前可拦截的已知风险&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台团队与黄金路径-治理的组织形态\">平台团队与黄金路径：治理的组织形态</h2><p>治理最终要有人来持有。完全去中心化（人人自定规则）会导致碎片化，完全中心化（中央团队审批一切）会扼杀自治——可行的中间形态是设一个<strong>平台团队</strong>，它不替业务团队做决定，而是提供&quot;黄金路径&quot;（golden path）：一套预配置好的脚手架、共享依赖版本基线、契约测试模板、部署清单工具，让团队沿黄金路径走时自动满足治理底线，又保留偏离的自由（偏离则自负其责）。</p>\n<p>平台团队的治理对象很集中：共享依赖的主版本基线、设计系统的版本化分发（以构建时集成形式，见 <a href=\"../integration/build-time-integration\">构建时集成</a>）、跨片段契约的注册与测试基础设施、以及那些被所有片段依赖的共享物（事件总线、版本清单服务）的所有权。这与 <a href=\"../concerns/shared-state-comms\">共享状态与通信</a> 里&quot;共享物必须有唯一 owner&quot;的戒律正好落到同一个组织角色上。治理做对的标志是：团队感觉不到治理在束缚自己，却又很少踩到彼此——自由与秩序在黄金路径上达成了和解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>治理的两难是既给团队自由维持自治、又守底线维持整体可用；做法是恰当规则而非消灭自由。</li>\n<li>共享依赖按是否核心运行时分级治理：核心运行时主版本须全局统一（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta major = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 才能共享单例），业务库片段自管。</li>\n<li>片段契约（事件载荷、远程接口、全局上下文）须向后兼容（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_p \\geq v_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且主版本一致），是容忍版本偏斜的前提。</li>\n<li>用消费者驱动契约测试把&quot;别改坏下游&quot;变成 CI 确定性门禁，对独立部署的片段尤为关键。</li>\n<li>治理的组织形态是平台团队 + 黄金路径：提供基线与工具而非审批一切；它持有共享依赖基线、设计系统、契约设施与共享物所有权。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"版本与治理","id":"版本与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"共享依赖的版本协商语义","id":"共享依赖的版本协商语义"},{"level":2,"text":"契约：让片段独立演进而不互相打破","id":"契约-让片段独立演进而不互相打破"},{"level":2,"text":"用契约测试守护，而非用人盯","id":"用契约测试守护-而非用人盯"},{"level":2,"text":"平台团队与黄金路径：治理的组织形态","id":"平台团队与黄金路径-治理的组织形态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"独立部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontend-engineering/engineering/independent-deployment"},"next":{"title":"性能与陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontend-engineering/engineering/performance-pitfalls"}}